        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Tempo traces\nUse `$service` to focus on API, auth or a worker, and `$minDuration` to hide very short spans. Open any trace in **Explore → Tempo** to inspect the span tree and database/HTTP children.\n\nWorker traces are available under `parser-worker`, `notifier` and `scheduler`; open a trace to inspect database and HTTP children.\n",
